{"id":"huntik:page:8110","page_id":8110,"title":"The Mist of Avalon","kind":"supporting_page","namespace":0,"summary":"The Mist of Avalon was the mission assigned to the Huntik team in which their goal was to investigate Avalon and its connection to the Casterwill family. After arriving in England the team were attacked by White and Mallory but Sophie was able prove to Nimue Casterwill that they were friends. [Cave of the Casterwills] With help from Nimue, the team was able to reach Avalon but Wilder and the Organization ambushed them in an attempt to sieze the Willblade. At the last minute Lok bonded with the Willblade and invoked the Legendary Titan of Champions, Pendragon; and forces the Organization to retreat. [Knight of the Willblade]","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:S2E29_Dante_Holotome_mist_of_Avalon.jpg","wikitext":"File:S2E29_Dante_Holotome_mist_of_Avalon.jpg","links":[]},"objectives":{"text":"Investigate Avalon's connection to the Casterwills.\n\n*Finds its location.","wikitext":"{{*}} Investigate Avalon's connection to the [[Casterwill family|Casterwills]]. <br>\n{{*}} *Finds its location.","links":[{"target_title":"Casterwill family","label":"Casterwills","target_id":"huntik:page:3280","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Casterwill_family","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3280"}]},"members":{"text":"Dante Vale\nLeBlanche\nLok Lambert\nSophie Casterwill\nZhalia Moon","wikitext":"[[Dante Vale]] <br> [[LeBlanche]]<br>[[Lok Lambert]] <br> [[Sophie Casterwill]] <br> [[Zhalia Moon]]","links":[{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_title":"LeBlanche","label":"LeBlanche","target_id":"huntik:page:2057","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/LeBlanche","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2057"},{"target_title":"Lok Lambert","label":"Lok Lambert","ta