in England the team were attacked by White and Mallory but Sophie was able prove to Nimue Casterwill that they were friends. [Cave of the Casterwills] With help from Nimue, the team was able to reach Avalon but Wilder and the Organization ambushed them in an attempt to sieze the Willblade. At the last minute Lok bonded with the Willblade and invoked the Legendary Titan of Champions, Pendragon; and forces the Organization to retreat. [Knight of the Willblade]","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox mission\n|image = File:S2E29_Dante_Holotome_mist_of_Avalon.jpg\n|objectives = {{*}} Investigate Avalon's connection to the [[Casterwill family|Casterwills]]. <br>\n{{*}} *Finds its location.\n|members = [[Dante Vale]] <br> [[LeBlanche]]<br>[[Lok Lambert]] <br> [[Sophie Casterwill]] <br> [[Zhalia Moon]]\n|episode = \"[[Cave of the Casterwills]]\" <br> \"[[Knight of the Willblade]]\"}}'''The Mist of Avalon''' was the mission assigned to the Huntik team in which their goal was to investigate Avalon and its connection to the [[Casterwill family]]. After arriving in England the team were attacked by [[White]] and [[Mallory]] but [[Sophie Casterwill|Sophie ]] was able prove to [[Nimue Casterwill]] that they were friends. {{source|Cave of the Casterwills}} With help from [[Nimue]], the team was able to reach Avalon but [[Wilder]] and [[the Organization ]] ambushed them in an attempt to sieze the [[Willblade]]. At the last minute [[Lok Lambert|Lok ]] bonded with the [[Willblade ]] and invoked the [[Pendragon|Legendary Titan of Champions, Pendragon]]; and forces [[the Organization]] to retreat. {{source|Knight of the Willblade}}\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation Missions]]","categories":["Huntik Foundation Missions"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:3280","status":"resolved","target_title":"Casterwill family","label":"Casterwills","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Casterwill_family","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3280"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2006","status":"resolved","target_title